<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/isPrimaryForTradition> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Religious tradition(s) that use this calendar system for their rites. Calendars are not divided by religion in Nepal: Nepal Sambat is the era of the Newar ritual calendar, used by Newar Hindus and Buddhists alike, and Bikram Sambat is the official civil era."@en .
