<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/KumariRetirementEvent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ritual or administrative event that formally ends a Living Goddess tenure according to tradition, returning the person to secular life. Record the event and its date, not the reason: the traditional grounds concern the bodily state of a child, and HeritageGraph does not record health or bodily data about persons."@en .
