<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/Chaitya> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Buddhist votive shrine (chaitya); votive stupa form found across the Kathmandu Valley. In Newar usage chaitya (Newar chibhah) also names great stupas (Swayambhu Mahachaitya), so a monument may be both a Stupa and a Chaitya."@en .
_:n908fb06c9e6143c3be2ae96a746557e3b547 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:n908fb06c9e6143c3be2ae96a746557e3b548 .
