<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/SelectionCriterion> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An eligibility criterion a candidate must satisfy to assume the Kumari role. Modelled as explicit subclasses so 'what are the eligibility criteria?' is a subclass query, not free text. Ethics: candidates are children. Criteria describe the tradition; data about how a named or identifiable child met them (bodily marks, health, horoscope) must not be recorded."@en .
